WEBVTT

observe
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Yang'anani kukula ndi kaonekedwe ka ana a maso onse awiri, ndipo muone ngati akufanana.

compare-observation
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Yerekezani ana a maso abwinobwino ndi amene asintha mtundu kapena kaonekedwe. Onaninso ngati kukula kwake n'kosiyana, ndipo yang'anani zikope.

light
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Yatsani Arclight ndi kusankha kuwala kwamphamvu kwambiri. Gwiritsani ntchito chipinda chabata chokhala ndi kuwala kochepa.

distance
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Pemphani wodwala kuti ayang'ane chinthu chakutali.

clear-view
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Onetsetsani kuti sakuyang'ana woyezayo kapena kuwala komweko.

move-light
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Sunthani kuwala kuchokera pambali kulunjika pa mwana wa diso.

watch
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Yang'anani mmene mwana wa diso amene waunikiridwa akuyankhira kuwalako.

shine-constrict
00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
Unikirani m'diso ndipo onani mwana wa diso akuchepa.

compare-responses
00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Onani ngati mwana wa diso akuchepa pang'ono kapena sakuchepa n'komwe.

corresponding-examples
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:18.000
Mayankho a ana a maso amene ali kumanzere angagwirizane ndi mavuto a kumbuyo kwa diso osonyezedwa kumanja.

pupil-colour
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Mtundu wa mwana wa diso sulamulira mmene amayankhira kuwala.

cataract-constriction
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:42.000
Ng'ala ingapangitse mwana wa diso kuoneka waimvi kapena woyera. Koma mwana wa disoyo ayenera kuchepabe ngati njira yoyendetsera kuyankha kuwala ikugwira ntchito.
